{"about_the_game":"Brichi is our hero!<br />\r\nOne day he finds a mysterious sword that suddenly transports him to an unknown land. Seven unique islands that need to be connected by bridges.<br />\r\nBrichi will have to explore this archipelago, full of mysteries and secrets. He needs to search every island and dungeon in search of an opportunity to return home. Many dangers and obstacles await him along the way. But behind every challenge, a treasure chest awaits him!<br />\r\nWhat can be stored inside each such chest? A powerful artifact? New weapon? Apples? Or a cute girlfriend in a witch hat?<br />\r\nEmbark on this adventure and see it all for yourself!<br />\r\nBut be careful, Brichi can\u2019t swim, avoid the water!<br />\r\nGood luck!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/aa29ecc26fd31958e9a1a772a50c8d141b60bbd6.jpg"},{"name":"Pyrotechnician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/61dfd14940431c22a5ecff427c2169bce7cca984.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/feca0fcdc9727e18cd48b474219564f46c950ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Ranger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/49f7114af6b3717cc4d5c86d5f4de8c82ea3dcb2.jpg"},{"name":"Sailor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/ca9bf00e3dbcf9aa9bc6cbd21f4b3b595fef6e61.jpg"},{"name":"Love at First Sight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/cd52732e559be6cd9fc6bf40717d825ffed3c93d.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/80e1a93c53898e0c465385a40f05a7441411f0de.jpg"},{"name":"Heart Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2126590/c06e94ff86909046ec2